143
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:56,380
Diga.

144
00:12:57,338 --> 00:12:58,588
Mas é meio brega.

145
00:12:59,797 --> 00:13:01,047
Diga.

146
00:13:03,630 --> 00:13:07,755
